  "description": "A classic of the Counter-Strike series, the edge of this knife is press-fit Stellite perfectly held in place due to its precise fit with the titanium on the blade's cheek and spine. The handle is fossilized mastodon ivory held in a carbon fibre pocket. It has been painted using a Digital Disruptive Pattern (DDPAT) hydrographic.\\n\\n<i>By the time you're close enough to notice the pixels it's already too late</i>",
